| `make eval` `[local]` | Replays every eval case: runs the case's real doer against its recorded response, marks a case whose prompt changed as stale, scores each answer with a deterministic scorer, and fails a suite below the threshold. It is a `make verify` goal, and makes no model call. | `make eval` | [`evals.dataset_dir`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evals.report_dir`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evals.threshold`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Judges recorded answers only, not today's model. Refuses (exit 2) zero cases, a malformed dataset or a report directory git does not ignore. Its case counts are not in the evidence record: only pytest's are. | [README_run.md](../../evals/README_run.md) | always |
